{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-added works, merged in by scripts/build-artworks.mjs after selection.",
    "",
    "For artists the automatic pipeline cannot serve. Wikidata only surfaces a",
    "work if someone has modelled it as an item with a creator and an image, and",
    "for artists still in copyright almost nobody has: Giacometti died in 1966,",
    "so his sculptures are protected until 2036, there are no free photographs of",
    "them, and Wikidata carried five items in total — one of which was a snapshot",
    "of a grave in Pere-Lachaise.",
    "",
    "Entries here bypass the fame threshold entirely and are always included, so",
    "only add works that are genuinely well known and genuinely by that artist.",
    "'title' and 'image' are required; everything else is optional and matches",
    "the shape build-artworks.mjs writes. Run npm run data, then npm run",
    "data:images to resolve sizes."
  ],

